"text":"யவிழ்ந்த","lemma":"யவிழ்ந்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஏகல்","parts":[{"text":"ஏகல்","lemma":"ஏகல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வெற்பன்","parts":[{"text":"வெற்பன்","lemma":"வெற்பன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்னர்","parts":[{"text":"நன்னர்","lemma":"nannar","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சத்தன்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சத்தன்","lemma":"நெஞ்சத்தன்","gloss":"he of the heart"}],"gloss":"he of the heart","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend!"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"nī","gloss":"your (oblique)"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"நிலை","parts":[{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"nilai","gloss":"state"}],"gloss":"state"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"yāṉ","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"தனக்கு","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"tāṉ","gloss":"himself/herself (oblique form)"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"increment"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"to (dative suffix)"}],"gloss":"to him"},{"surface":"உரைத்தனென்","parts":[{"text":"உரைத்தனென்","lemma":"உரைத்தனென்","gloss":"I spoke"}],"gloss":"I spoke","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆக","parts":[{"text":"ஆக","lemma":"āka","gloss":"as/when"}],"gloss":"as/when"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"tāṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"நாணினன்","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"nāṇ","gloss":"feel ashamed"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he (third person masculine singular suffix)"}],"gloss":"he felt ashamed"},{"surface":"இஃது","parts":[{"text":"இஃது","lemma":"ihtu","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"ஆகா","parts":[{"text":"ஆகா","lemma":"āku","gloss":"not happening/improper"}],"gloss":"improper"},{"surface":"ஆறு","parts":[{"text":"ஆறு","lemma":"āṟu","gloss":"way/manner"}],"gloss":"way"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]}],"literal":"The beautiful, plump bud of the Malabar glory lily, not holding its guard / at the time when the bee opens its mouth, as always / like the duty-bound people who see the noble ones of known righteousness / yielding space, / the lord of the lofty mountain where the petals' binding blossomed / is of a good heart, O friend! Your state / as I spoke to him, / he felt ashamed, saying 'this is not the proper way'.","translation":"O friend, the lord of the lofty mountain—where the plump, beautiful buds of the Malabar glory lily cannot hold their guard and yield space, opening their petal-bindings when the bees open their mouths, just like duty-bound people who step aside respectfully upon seeing noble, righteous souls they know—is indeed of a virtuous heart. When I spoke to him of your suffering state, he felt deeply ashamed, realizing that this delay in marriage is not the proper way.","modern":"தோழி! வண்டுகள் தம் வாயைத் திறந்து தேனை உண்ணும் காலத்தில், தாம் அறிந்த நேர்மையான சான்றோரைக் கண்ட கடமையுணர்வுள்ள மக்கள் வழிவிட்டு ஒதுங்கி நிற்பது போல, காந்தளின் அழகிய பருத்த மொட்டுகள் தம் காவலைக் கடந்து இதழ்களின் கட்டுகள் அவிழ்ந்து மலரும் உயர்ந்த மலைநாட்டை உடைய தலைவன் நல்ல நெஞ்சத்தை உடையவன் ஆவான். உன்னுடைய வருத்தமான நிலையை நான் அவனிடம் எடுத்துச் சொன்னபோது, 'இது தகுந்த நெறி அன்று' என்று அவன் தன் செயலுக்காக மிகவும் நாணமடைந்தான்.","explanation":"The friend is speaking to the heroine to comfort her by reporting the hero's reaction when she described her distress. She assures the heroine that the hero is a man of noble character who will soon seek a formal marriage. The description of the mountain landscape features the Malabar glory lily buds opening as bees approach. The buds yielding space to the bees is compared to polite, duty-bound people stepping aside in respect when they encounter righteous elders. This image of respectful yielding reflects the hero's own noble nature; just as the flowers yield to the bees and the polite people yield to the wise, the hero's heart immediately yielded to the truth of his duty when confronted with the heroine's plight.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[1.9,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.47],[3.5,4.1],[4.1,4.53],[4.53,5.1],[5.1,5.5],[5.5,6.1],[6.1,6.8],[6.8,7.0],[7.0,7.3],[7.3,8.42],[8.42,9.37],[9.46,9.71],[9.71,10.53],[10.53,10.95],[10.95,11.37],[11.37,12.0],[12.0,12.3],[12.3,12.8],[13.05,14.1],[14.17,14.43],[14.68,14.85],[15.02,15.2],[15.2,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[15.8,16.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.8],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,3.4],[3.4,3.7],[3.7,3.95],[4.0,4.7],[4.7,5.21],[5.21,5.9],[5.9,6.4],[6.4,7.2],[7.2,7.8],[7.8,8.0],[8.0,8.4],[8.4,9.2],[9.2,9.91],[9.91,10.61],[10.61,11.04],[11.04,11.6],[11.6,12.4],[12.4,12.9],[12.9,13.06],[13.06,13.38],[13.38,13.78],[13.78,14.18],[14.18,14.42],[14.42,14.58],[14.58,14.9],[14.9,15.06],[15.06,15.23]]},"sync":[[["காந்தள்","Malabar glory lily"],["அம்","beautiful"]],[["கொழு","plump"],["முகை","bud"]],[["காவல்","guarding"]],[["செல்லாது","not holding"]],[["வண்டு","bee"],["வாய்","mouth"]],[["திறக்கும்","opening"]],[["பொழுதின்","at the time"]],[["பண்டும்","even in the past"]],[["தாம்","they"],["அறி","knowing"]],[["செம்மை","righteousness"],["சான்றோர்","noble people"]],[["சான்றோர்","noble people"],["கண்ட","seen"]],[["கண்ட","seen"]],[["கடனறி",""]],[["மாக்கள்",""]],[["போல",""]],[["இடன்விட்",""]],[["டிதழ்தளை",""]],[["யவிழ்ந்த",""]],[["ஏகல்",""]],[["வெற்பன்",""]],[["நன்னர்","good"]],[["நெஞ்சத்தன்","he of the heart"]],[["தோழி","O friend!"]],[["நின்","your"],["நிலை","state"]],[["யான்","I"],["தனக்கு","to him"]],[["தனக்கு","to him"],["உரைத்தனென்","I spoke"]],[["உரைத்தனென்","I spoke"],["ஆக","as/when"]],[["தான்","he"],["நாணினன்","he felt ashamed"]],[["நாணினன்","he felt ashamed"],["இஃது","this"]],[["இஃது","this"],["ஆகா","improper"]],[["ஆறு","way"]]]}